 title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3070-barbrarilen","name":"Barbrarilen","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3070_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"268"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-07T04:21:46-07:00","id":471083,"title":"","content":"Would you like Joseph to have run into Akule Okami? <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2650-retias","name":"Retias","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"192"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-07T05:49:32-07:00","id":471152,"title":"","content":"Eh, i don't see it as too necessary. I like to imagine they were all communicating somewhat with each other over the occasional chat room or call but like the notion of still being relatively new with each other.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1705-okami","name":"Okami","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1705_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"152"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-07T08:17:21-07:00","id":471225,"title":"","content":"I think that's fine - this is the band getting together. Joseph joined a day ago. Akule is in limbo for you to define in your next post. St, i think we are ready.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3070-barbrarilen","name":"Barbrarilen","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3070_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"268"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-09T18:42:40-07:00","id":475189,"title":"","content":"Guys, I am so ready.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5279-amravanti","name":"Amravanti","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5279_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"465"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-09T21:13:04-07:00","id":475346,"title":"","content":"Welll then just post something! : D","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3070-barbrarilen","name":"Barbrarilen","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3070_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"268"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-09T21:41:56-07:00","id":475360,"title":"","content":"My apologies folks, work has been particularly draining these past few days. Tomorrow I'm off though and will have our prologue and first official scene posted sometime within.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3436-dusksage","name":"Dusksage","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3436_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"869"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-10T06:39:04-07:00","id":475751,"title":"","content":"Its alright, life does tend to do that. Thanks for keeping us up to date. Honestly, when things like that do come up, its really good to just hear a one liner from someone rather than they go dark for a few days. The former lets us know we're waiting on a series of events to run their course. The latter sparks our silent fears of posting boards suddenly going silent.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1705-okami","name":"Okami","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1705_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"152"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-10T12:34:43-07:00","id":476205,"title":"","content":"Understood, I've had experiences with Live Games going dark so I promise that if something were to come up and I wouldn't be able to do this anymore then I would let all of you know immediatly.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3436-dusksage","name":"Dusksage","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3436_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"869"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-11T14:03:08-07:00","id":477273,"title":"","content":"So, with our first IC posts about to be underway I just realized... Where are we? That diner I mentioned in mine? Someone's apartment? A park? Our pack has yet to find its lovely abandoned church that it will turn into a bar, and has no totem. So my character will be treating those as a priority, and these rumors of another pack's problem's as just that, another packs problems (though he will definitely be making inquiries as to this black smoke spirit, as he assumes its a spirit, no way they should be caught off guard if they can help it).<br /> <br /> Also, now that I start to enter things into the IC I realized, how are we handling roles?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1705,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1705-okami","user":"Okami","date":". 04-12-2015, 12:36 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1705-okami","name":"Okami","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1705_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"152"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-12T17:25:14-07:00","id":478533,"title":"","content":"That is an excellent question, and I hadn't really thought about it in regards to the player characters. Perhaps we can just have a Role...call? <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> All kidding aside if anyone wanted a specific role in the Lack please post and discuss.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3436-dusksage","name":"Dusksage","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3436_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"869"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-12T17:29:21-07:00","id":478534,"title":"","content":"I was amused Aliza was called boss. She will also be amused. We never decided how 'strict' we wanted to be after all, yeah?<br /> <br /> She didn't see herself as an Alpha so much as someone with ambition. Less a 'I lead you' than an 'I need all of you to do X of we keep going' - an organizer.<br /> <br /> If y'all need an alpha though. She will. ^^","signature":"","edited":{"userid":3070,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3070-barbrarilen","user":"Barbrarilen","date":". 04-12-2015, 08:52 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3070-barbrarilen","name":"Barbrarilen","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3070_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"268"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-12T19:13:01-07:00","id":478600,"title":"","content":"I'm okay with Aliza being the alpha, though I don't think we necessarily need a strict hierarchy. I think she would probably end up with a lot of pull anyway as one of the more mature pack members and sort of the mother figure of a pack with a couple youngsters. (though I don't actually know how old she is, she might not really be that much older than some of the members)<br /> <br /> And sorry I jumped in late on the IC. Been swamped. I too was wondering where we were situated and what time it was, how far along we were, etc. Props to Bar for kicking things off. Thanks.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":5279,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5279-amravanti","user":"Amravanti","date":". 04-12-2015, 10:15 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5279-amravanti","name":"Amravanti","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5279_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"465"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-13T04:04:06-07:00","id":478938,"title":"","content":"Akule is likely to prod at things, as via his last post, but when things become more clear to him he's likely to calm down some.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2650-retias","name":"Retias","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"192"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-13T04:31:18-07:00","id":478943,"title":"","content":"Am I waiting for st intervention or posting again in the order? I can delete whatever I post if its out of order :-)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3070-barbrarilen","name":"Barbrarilen","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3070_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"268"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-13T04:38:26-07:00","id":478948,"title":"","content":"I'd go for posting unless the ST drops something on our heads. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/biggrin.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Big Grin\" smilieid=\"3\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2650-retias","name":"Retias","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"192"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-13T04:52:59-07:00","id":478954,"title":"","content":"Done <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> Since it was the first reply I didn't want to leave anyone out, sorry if it felt stilted though. I will smooth out Alixa's conversing once everyone isn't just reacting to her. And sorry to deny Indy her breakfast. ^^ Composure checks for everyone! <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/biggrin.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Big Grin\" smilieid=\"3\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3070-barbrarilen","name":"Barbrarilen","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3070_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"268"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-13T06:32:28-07:00","id":479014,"title":"","content":"I still don't know how we're handling rolls :/.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1705-okami","name":"Okami","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1705_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"152"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-13T08:15:50-07:00","id":479057,"title":"","content":"Well you don't need to until asked, no? :-)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3070-barbrarilen","name":"Barbrarilen","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3070_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"268"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-13T12:00:57-07:00","id":479328,"title":"","content":"Hey all, works been distracting me for the past few days. Love what I've read so far. I'll be responding to personal knowledges via individual PMs.<br /> <br /> As for rolls I'm instigating the Trust System: roll using your regular dice and just post the results. Mark ten-agains rolls with an * to indicate that they are additional bonus dice due to re-rolls.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3436-dusksage","name":"Dusksage","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3436_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"869"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-13T13:09:43-07:00","id":479386,"title":"","content":"We post the results here I assume?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1705-okami","name":"Okami","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1705_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"152"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-13T13:27:48-07:00","id":479404,"title":"","content":"If people need a dice roller website I like to use <a href=\"http://www.umbralechoes.com/WoD2Roller.php\" target=\"_blank\">this one</a>. If you look further down the list you can see I (as Indiana) rolled a practice die earlier. It records your roll for a little while and its made specifically for NWoD so it has all the tools for various mechanics (such as rote or 9 agains, etc). Its pretty handy.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5279-amravanti","name":"Amravanti","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5279_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"465"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-14T08:04:53-07:00","id":480244,"title":"","content":"I'm fine if everyone wants to use the dice roller site. <br /> <br /> Anywho it looks like the Pack's forming a plan. Is everyone ready to move from downtime to scene 01? If not then post what you want to before it's too late, if so just post so here on the OOC thread. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3436-dusksage","name":"Dusksage","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3436_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"869"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-14T08:19:59-07:00","id":480257,"title":"","content":"In good to go. Figured I answered questions and gave marching orders :-)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3070-barbrarilen","name":"Barbrarilen","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3070_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"268"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-14T08:35:01-07:00","id":480269,"title":"","content":"I'm all good to go. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> Akule may propose grabbing one of the Pure wolfblooded for interrogation if possible though.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2650-retias","name":"Retias","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"192"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-14T09:02:52-07:00","id":480286,"title":"","content":"Definitely ready.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5279-amravanti","name":"Amravanti","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5279_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"465"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-14T09:19:22-07:00","id":480298,"title":"","content":"I do have a question: do any of us have mentors or at least familiar faces with any victory city packs from teaching us or initiating us into their tribes post change?<br /> <br /> Er, two questions; pack name anyone?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":3070,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3070-barbrarilen","user":"Barbrarilen","date":". 04-14-2015, 12:25 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3070-barbrarilen","name":"Barbrarilen","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3070_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"268"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-14T11:48:06-07:00","id":480528,"title":"","content":"I like to imagine that after a few months spent prowling the street after her first change, Indiana was taken in for a brief time by the Root Walkers. They would've have mentored her, initiated her into the Hunters in Darkness as she was a clear fit. Of course they probably weren't looking to add any more members into their pack, so they sent her on her way armed with some knowledge of herself and what she was, as well as the world she was now a part of.<br /> <br /> That's the easiest explanation to me of how she joined the tribe. Of course, it could also have been an outside group or pack. The Root Walkers could even just have guided her in the direction of a tribe elder, and otherwise had very little dealing with Indy directly themselves if the ST decides that's more appropriate for them.<br /> <br /> <br /> As far as a pack name, I have no idea. I've always been bad at that. Are we assuming we have already chosen a name? We haven't defined a territory or a totem yet, but I imagine a name is usually the first order of business.<br /> <br /> <br /> I posted again. I know I said I was done but I'm done this time for real.<br /> <br /> Edit: Also, I'm sorry for assuming Violet wears laced sneakers, haha. I just went back and checked the picture you posted and apparently she's wearing something with a strap. I can go back and change it if you'd like.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":5279,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5279-amravanti","user":"Amravanti","date":". 04-14-2015, 02:50 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5279-amravanti","name":"Amravanti","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5279_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"465"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-14T12:19:04-07:00","id":480589,"title":"","content":"I'll post IC in a bit, but Violet has just had Akule use memeto mori on her.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2650-retias","name":"Retias","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"192"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-14T17:28:47-07:00","id":480948,"title":"","content":"So, seeing as we haven't hunted our totem yet and my brain doing what it does I've been ruminating some more on the totem's appearance and Barbrarilen's suggestion of going for a less organic theme. I definitely like what we have and am totally good with what the pack wants, I just enjoy looking at new ideas.<br /> <br /> What if the spirit was actually a surface of stained glass with a coating of crystal clear water that bubbled up from the center and you walked upon? Whose image changed based on who it was speaking to? The voice would sound from all around. Any time it needed to take a more convenient form (say for fighting) it could just rearrange itself to a three-dimentional object.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1705-okami","name":"Okami","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1705_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"152"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-14T21:31:05-07:00","id":481107,"title":"","content":"I've always had trouble visualizing and/or connecting with amorphous spirits. I feel like they don't have enough character to make an impression on me. I'm just a visual creature, I guess. Maybe if we really play up the atmosphere its shape changing creates, that might be able to help it stick with me.<br /> <br /> Also, just in case there was any confusion, Violet is the one who went off to announce our arrival to Behemoth's Wake.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5279-amravanti","name":"Amravanti","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5279_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"465"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-15T05:30:57-07:00","id":481278,"title":"","content":"Oops, my bad, meant Violet, edited.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1705-okami","name":"Okami","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1705_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"152"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-15T11:46:11-07:00","id":481436,"title":"","content":"Don't have my book handy. What's memento mori do again?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3070-barbrarilen","name":"Barbrarilen","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3070_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"268"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-15T12:06:31-07:00","id":481450,"title":"","content":"&quot;For the Facet\u2019s duration, the Uratha is aware of exactly how much damage her packmates have suffered and can, as a Reflexive action, transfer wounds onto herself. Each turn, she may absorb up to her Honor Renown in points of bashing or lethal damage from packmates who she can perceive, or a single point of aggravated damage. The wounds immediately open up on her own body, and it is quite possible for a foolish or desperate Uratha to kill herself in this way.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5279-amravanti","name":"Amravanti","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5279_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"465"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-17T06:02:43-07:00","id":483459,"title":"","content":"W-Where did everyone go? O-O <br /> <br /> On another note while we all take care of real-life things, Beast: The Primordial has hit open development and has some pretty awesome blog posts to check out.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1705-okami","name":"Okami","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1705_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"152"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-17T06:30:15-07:00","id":483481,"title":"","content":"It is interesting, isn't it? A little high fantasy and a little bit back to the roots of that dark evil leech/spirit/beast/hunger clawing at the soul in Vampire","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3070-barbrarilen","name":"Barbrarilen","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3070_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"268"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-17T07:46:23-07:00","id":483531,"title":"","content":"I can't really decide whether or not I would want to go Leviathan or make a classic Grendel.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1705-okami","name":"Okami","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1705_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"152"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-17T11:18:49-07:00","id":483757,"title":"","content":"Ah, Beast is looking just as I had hoped it would be. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> P.S. Will get started on the first scene soon so IC can resume.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3436-dusksage","name":"Dusksage","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3436_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"869"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-17T16:29:09-07:00","id":483990,"title":"","content":"Now that the updated character sheets around, I got around to actually making a human character. Hope it's not too late. <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/0BxK0La5plUm8RzNjOENtT3R2c0E/view?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">Allison Millner</a> is Indy's (former?) best friend and she runs/writes a Victory City based conspiracy blog. She's known as 'Millenium' online (which is basically the only place she's known). I can't remember all the human characters made, but I don't remember any being internet/computer based so I hope that doesn't step on any toes.<br /> <br /> On the topic of Beast, it really does sound pretty neat. No idea which type I'd make because they all sound pretty fun in their own way.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":5279,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5279-amravanti","user":"Amravanti","date":". 04-17-2015, 07:32 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5279-amravanti","name":"Amravanti","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5279_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Joi