_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"268"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-23T23:28:58-07:00","id":490258,"title":"","content":"Nope, I can do that! When do you want the res tof the pack to make the scene?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5337-soonmot","name":"soonmot","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5337_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"64"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-24T00:05:04-07:00","id":490274,"title":"","content":"Oh thank goodness, though I made him too snarky and alienated my player base. Phew!<br /> <br /> As for the rest of the Pack I'd say that after Hank finished talking to Violet or they reach the from door to the Wild Rose there will be one of those Violet smiles as the camera pans to her side to show her Pack just then reaching that adjacent office building. I'm a sucker for the cinematic shot since we're using the medium of the written word. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3436-dusksage","name":"Dusksage","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3436_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"869"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-24T07:17:25-07:00","id":490504,"title":"","content":"We got any order we were looking to respond in? My inkling was to wait for Aliza since she was in front and I don't like implying anything about characters that aren't my own.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1705-okami","name":"Okami","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1705_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"152"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-24T10:22:06-07:00","id":490691,"title":"","content":"Nah I was going to wait for everyone else. I will post something Saturday afternoon. Anyone who wants to post before that can. ^^<br /> <br /> Unless everyone else posts/passes before then.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3070-barbrarilen","name":"Barbrarilen","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3070_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"268"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-27T15:02:41-07:00","id":493972,"title":"","content":"While we're waiting to meet the rest of Behemoth's Wake (or whatever is inside the Roadhouse), have we decided on a pack name yet? How are we introducing ourselves to Behemoth? Anyone have any ideas?<br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5279-amravanti","name":"Amravanti","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5279_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"465"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-27T16:56:53-07:00","id":494068,"title":"","content":"I'm sure Aliza's dramatic side will come out if she tries to think up a name specifically, but don't forget, they haven't fully agreed to stick together and don't have a totem binding them yet. so that might be the catalyst that does it?<br /> <br /> OOC, I think that between Aliza's whole 'the moon speaks to me oooooh' and the general urban, positive, energetic vibe the group seems to have going for it, some colorful words to jangle around in your heads that would resonate well with her are ones of speech (like, they have been Spoken to by Luna) of the city itself (name the pack after the landmark, neighborhood, or main street/thoroughfare their territory is based in), various permutations of destiny (see aforementioned Luna-speaking) and of course things like Sound, Noise, etc. because cities are not always very particularly quiet places.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3070-barbrarilen","name":"Barbrarilen","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3070_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"268"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-27T20:26:09-07:00","id":494298,"title":"","content":"Is anyone else going to speak or take action before entering the roadhouse? If not please post here.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3436-dusksage","name":"Dusksage","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3436_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"869"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-28T00:59:29-07:00","id":494502,"title":"","content":"I'm ready to get inside. Pretty sure there isn't much else to say outside with the door being held open.<br /> <br /> <br /> As far as pack names, how about Vox Populi (Voice of the People), or Luna's Somethings. Like I said, I'm bad with pack names, and I don't know the names of any geography or landmarks or the neighbourhood to bounce off of. <br /> <br /> Sure I could make some up. Like... the Ghosts of Wicker Bridge or the Bloomington Honey Badgers or something.<br /> <br /> Like I said, I'm bad with pack names.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5279-amravanti","name":"Amravanti","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5279_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"465"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-28T04:35:05-07:00","id":494592,"title":"","content":"Hey, I wouldn't pick a fight with the Bloomington Honeybadgers. Honeybadgers don't give no @%$#s.<br /> <br /> Vox Luna works too <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />. And yes, ST. Just post. 24 or 48 or whatever hour grace period, eh?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3070-barbrarilen","name":"Barbrarilen","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3070_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"268"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-28T08:24:14-07:00","id":494850,"title":"","content":"I'm good with us proceeding inside. As far as a name goes Barbrarilen read my mind, I think it should be an awesome climactic moment after we bind with our totem. Sorry I haven't been around too much lately. I have been lurking to keep an eye on things but have been super busy so I haven't been directly active. It's finals season here and I'm graduating <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/tongue.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Stick Out Tongue\" smilieid=\"5\" class=\"inlineimg\" />.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1705-okami","name":"Okami","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1705_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"152"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-28T23:33:56-07:00","id":495991,"title":"","content":"Voice of the City? Sure, it makes sense to name ourselves after the totem binding. Makes sense.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5279-amravanti","name":"Amravanti","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5279_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"465"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-01T04:26:32-07:00","id":498613,"title":"","content":"Nice work Amravanti, I will post in the morning unless anyone else wants to post before me. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3436-dusksage","name":"Dusksage","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3436_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"869"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-01T04:33:50-07:0