 /> And now to end round one of the Social Challenge!<br /> <br /> All done, round 1 is not over and time to explain the nuance of the Social Combate. Each round takes a certain amount of time to pass before moving on to the next one, each depending on the impressions of the targets about the player characters. The more friendly the less time is neaded to advance to the next round, and baring a certain amount of Doors being locked through truly bad rolls or horrendous wordplay then this continues until the Player's desired intentions have been meet. Players can choose new intentions each round, but doing so requires them to be geared to one of the player's Asparitions. I will post the chart for the Behemoth's Wake later on today but other than that nice work everyone and really sorry again about how long this took to go up. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":3436,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3436-dusksage","user":"Dusksage","date":".  Latest Update 06-03-2015, 04:37 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3436-dusksage","name":"Dusksage","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3436_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"869"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-03T06:00:32-07:00","id":538126,"title":"","content":"So is the next round (presuming we don't want to push and get into a fight) going to be next week or something? I think I am going to have Aliza do some &quot;propheteering&quot; to have us reconnect with the pack and get our foot in the door again..? When its my turn again at least","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.co