osting it up later on today. Hope everyone's having a good week and look forward to what the Pack does next in Downtime. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3436-dusksage","name":"Dusksage","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3436_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"869"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-12T18:33:41-07:00","id":552436,"title":"","content":"Okami, we already jumped to downtime, but could you tell us in ooc what was on that scrap of paper?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3070-barbrarilen","name":"Barbrarilen","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3070_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"268"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-13T02:25:03-07:00","id":552770,"title":"","content":"Great opening for Downtime <b>Barbrarilen</b>,<br /> <br /> It's time i gave a few updates of my own, starting with this long overdue gem: Behemoth's Wake Impressions List<br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-size:14px\">Greg, the A-Hole: Hostile</span><br /> <span style=\"font-size:14px\">Hank, the Straight Shooter: Good (Normal with Indiana)</span><br /> <span style=\"font-size:14px\">?, the Bone Shadow Ithaeur Bartender: Normal (Good with Joseph and Violet)</span><br /> <span style=\"font-size:14px\">?, the Wolf-Blooded Rose of Fire: Normal</span><br /> <span style=\"font-size:14px\">?, the Wolf-Blooded Mechanic: Normal<br /> <br /> Behemoth's Wake Doors Opened: 1/?</span><br /> <br /> <br /> And now for the fruits of Aliza's studies: The Territory Map<br /> <br /> Victory City: The Blood River<br /> <br /> - Known Tribes of the Moon Territory<br /> &gt; Victory City Sewers: Root Walkers (Alpha Pack)<br /> &gt; Victory State College Campus: Whisper Catchers<br /> &gt; Docktown Shopping District: Half-Light Studios<br /> &gt; 127 Highway: Behemoth's Wake<br /> <br /> - Known Pure Tribes Territory<br /> &gt; Lakehights Buisness District: ?<br /> &gt; Victory City Nature Reserve: ?<br /> &gt; Docktown Projects: ?<br /> <br /> - Known Ghost Wolves Territory<br /> &gt; Avalon Gated Community: Knights of Avalon<br /> <br /> - Open Territory<br /> &gt; Docktown Warehouse District<br /> &gt; Lakehights Suburbs<br /> &gt; Oaksway Lumber District<br /> &gt; Oaksway Residential Area<br /> &gt; Old Traveler's Road<br /> &gt; Victory City College Campus<br /> &gt; Victory City Freedom Mall<br /> &gt; 18th Street Residential Area<br /> &gt; Victory Hills<br /> <br /> (Noted: the characters are aware that the Pure have a fresh new pack looking for territory as well. P.S. I know the group has their eyes set on this church made speakeasy, and the above Territory Chart is more to give you all the freedom to plop this location at any of the above open spots. That way it's location can add to it's history.)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":3436,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3436-dusksage","user":"Dusksage","date":".  Almost forgot 06-13-2015, 05:29 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3436-dusksage","name":"Dusksage","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3436_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"869"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-13T08:28:33-07:00","id":553065,"title":"","content":"Oh shoot, sorry about that. I've been busy here recently (going to my brother's wedding today!) On the scrap of paper was simply<br /> <br /> 'It is not of the Shadow' <br /> <br /> Which has left my character rather upset.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1705-okami","name":"Okami","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1705_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"152"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-13T19:50:12-07:00","id":553666,"title":"","content":"Yay! Thanks for the compliment Dusk, and grats to your brother, Okami!<br /> <br /> So which neighborhood do we want to find home in? I did my best to be vague in the post at least about naming it. I was picturing something either in the old growth of the city and/or on the water, far from the highways and city limits.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3070-barbrarilen","name":"Barbrarilen","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3070_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"268"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-15T13:00:43-07:00","id":555933,"title":"","content":"My vote would be for definitely on the water, I remember that being a thing in our early discussions.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1705-okami","name":"Okami","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1705_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"152"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-15T16:30:02-07:00","id":556210,"title":"","content":"So, doing a little mental sketching out here:there are already pure tribes represented in Lakeheights and Docktown, so if we take on one of their adjacent neighborhoods, we'll have rivals. Similarly, Halflife Studios is already in Docktown, so if anything, we'd be further encroaching on the Anshega, and get even more attention.<br /> <br /> So basically if we go for the Docktown Warehouse District, we're begging for trouble. I won't vote against them if the water is important, but I'm a lot more curious about the 18th Street/Oaksway Residentials and Old Travelers Road areas - both also sound to me like spots that might have urban resurgence.... and less problems from the Pure.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3070-barbrarilen","name":"Barbrarilen","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3070_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"268"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-15T16:43:26-07:00","id":556218,"title":"","content":"During downtime the pack can conduct investigations, research, or rumor gathering for one of the areas. However, each PC can only make one roll for one area. They may also add their dots in either Allies, Mentor, or Contact if they can justify using them to help with their roll. The states for the rolls are:<br /> <br /> Investigation: Wits + Investigation - Rival Pack's Subterfuge.<br /> <br /> Research: Intelligence + Academics - Area's Mystery Rating (A score correlating to the cities dark secrets. Each area' rating is purposefully hidden from the players.) <br /> <br /> Rumor Gathering: Wits + Socialize or Streetwise (each will yield a different result) - Rival Pack's Subterfuge.<br /> <br /> P.S. Fully Updated Map of Victory City<br /> <br /> \u2022 Victory City Overview \u2022<br /> (*) = Forsaken Territory<br /> (**) = Pure Territory<br /> (***) = Ghost Wolves Territory<br /> <br /> Docktown<br /> - Projects**<br /> - Warehouse District<br /> - Shopping District*<br /> - Victory City College<br /> - Avalon Gated Community***<br /> <br /> Lakehights <br /> - Business District**<br /> - Suburbs<br /> - 18th Street Residential<br /> - City Hall<br /> <br /> Oaksway<br /> - Residential Area<br /> - Freedom Mall<br /> - Victory State College*<br /> - Lumber District<br /> <br /> City Infrastructure<br /> - City Sewers*<br /> - 127 Highway*<br /> - Hydro Electric Plant<br /> <br /> Outskirts<br /> - Old Travelers Road<br /> - Victory Hills<br /> - Victory City Nature Reserve**","signature":"","edited":{"userid":3436,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3436-dusksage","user":"Dusksage","date":".  Updated 06-15-2015, 07:56 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3436-dusksage","name":"Dusksage","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3436_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"869"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-16T01:52:55-07:00","id":556680,"title":"","content":"I'm going to have a post up in the next two days giving us leads towards our territory that should line up with barbrarilen's research post.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5337-soonmot","name":"soonmot","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5337_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"64"}]},